WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.540
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:08.180
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed. Do they want to protect themselves or other people?

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.740
Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.730
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.340
To an endless, eternal picture of hell,

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:19.400
pushing through time, a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:24.000
Your grudge shall be released.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:56.860
Yamatami Optometry

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.330
Whenever…

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:43.040
…it’s a dead end…

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:50.130
…you can’t escape.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:53.470
To the birds of the sky…

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:54.650
That was cold!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:01.490
Who…

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:12.520
…are you?

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:37.800
Hey, Baldy!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.840
Y-You!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.820
How have you been, Baldy?

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.850
What’re you doing?  When did you come back?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.060
Come with me, she’s calling!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.050
Who’s calling?

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:55.280
Whee!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.130
Wait, could it be…?

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:06.420
Whee!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.920
Even though I’ve finally become an adult,

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.870
while knowing bad men,

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:19.030
I wanted to see how it felt to be held…

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:21.410
Welcome!

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:26.780
What, a prank?

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.840
I wonder why?

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.790
Ojou.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:59.810
The Girl Who was Taken

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:09.830
This program is brought to you by Sony Music and Aniplex.

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:37.050
Note says: “Tange bugs me”

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:44.850
What’s this?

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.680
Did you draw this?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.520
Hmm…

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:58.190
Migake Takasugi, michievous doodling during class.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:05:59.590
Be more serious!

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:04.580
You’re in your third year of middle school!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.240
You’ll reap what you sow.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:07.980
Sensei!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:08.910
What, Hiraishi?

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:12.120
It was me.  I wrote it.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.600
You?  Okay, then.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.980
Yuzuki, and Akie have nothing to do with it!

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.700
Please erase what you just wrote!

00:06:21.470 --> 00:06:24.480
If you don’t want to be a high school dropout,

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.620
attend class seriously.

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.670
This isn’t just to scare you.

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:41.270
Sue?

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:42.640
You’re going to sue Tange-sensei?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.380
I’ve disliked him for a while.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.560
He’s always writing in his notebook when something happens.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:52.650
Akie, your dad knows the principal, right?

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:53.800
What?

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.980
You’re going to tell the principal?

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:59.480
We’re going to have him fire that treacherous teacher.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.890
Tell your father.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:01.980
But!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.990
Are you fine with the way things are?

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.950
With someone like that as your homeroom teacher,

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.420
you really will become a high school dropout!

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.610
That’s a bit much, Itsuko…

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:15.130
So far, three people have dropped out.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.850
Three?

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.790
That many?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.880
Yeah.  I heard it from an upperclassman.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:29.800
Which is why, Akie, I impore you.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.050
Our futures depend on it.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:46.150
Eavesdropping on your students, Sanae-sensei?

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.370
Good taste!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.330
You’re messing around too much, Ishimoto-sensei.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.060
O-Ouch!

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:02.280
Why did Ojou come back?

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:06.030
I don’t know, but we might find out if we stay at this school.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:07.430
What about Kikuri?

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.020
She said she doesn’t know.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:13.730
I’m back, Baldy!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.530
You must be tired, Yamawaro.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:16.600
No, not at all.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.660
Sorry for placing such a burden on you.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:23.580
What!?  A burden?!  Try saying that again!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:27.080
Hmm?

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:28.130
It ran out.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.060
Ran out?

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.050
What did?

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.410
Yamawaro, wind it.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.610
Yes, Hime.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.930
Is she saying that her spring ran out?

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.830
It seems that she attached herself to a toy because she doesn’t have a real body.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.930
So you’re calling her “Hime”, Yama-waro?

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.550
Yes, she told me to call her that.

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:46.400
I’m Kikuri-hime!  Call me Hime!  You erotic eyeball! {not sure if it should be erotic eyeball unless its some kind of name it makes more sense if it was perverted eyeball if thats what its meaning}

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.290
Says the stingy artificial girl…

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.540
I’m finished, Hime!

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:52.580
Waro-waro, you’re a good boy so I’ll make you one of my subjects!

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:56.280
Akie, I’m counting on you.

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:58.050
Okay, I understand.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:00.820
See you later!

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:01.850
Bye bye!

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:06.530
See you!

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:08.530
Yeah, see you tomorrow!

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:35.790
Is Akie really going to say something?

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:03.980
It’s cold…

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.150
What?

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.880
Open.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.160
What?

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:48.210
Was that a dream?

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:56.490
It didn’t work?

00:10:56.490 --> 00:11:00.280
I talked to him, but he said it’s impossible without evidence.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.590
But…

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.530
It’ll be fine.

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:06.430
Tange-sensei won’t really write it in our school reports.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.170
Akie…

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:12.270
I think so, and my dad agreed,

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.690
so I’ll…

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:15.030
Sorry!

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:15.720
Akie!

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.930
Yuzuki, you’re not going to run away, are you?

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:22.030
You don’t trust Tange, right?

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:24.020
You want to get him fired, right?

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:26.120
I…

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:28.080
Work with me!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.200
We’ll find evidence and give it to the principal.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.130
Evidence?

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:33.770
You mean that notebook?

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.220
More than that, we’ll make even better evidence!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.390
Make?

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.310
Hey, maybe we should think this over…

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:45.630
What are you saying?

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:48.300
We already put the letter in his shoebox…

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.650
Maybe if we said it was a prank…

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:53.710
If we did something like that, we’d just be marked off again!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.560
Then we’d be guarenteed not to get into a high school!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.420
But…

00:11:56.810 --> 00:12:01.830
“I’m sorry, I was only trying to get attention through a prank!”

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.640
“Please meet me and scold me!”

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:08.060
He’ll definitely enjoy it; he looks like he’s had no experience whatsoever.

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:10.410
Okay?

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:16.030
When he comes, I’ll hug him, so make sure the hotel sign’s in the picture.

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:17.710
Tricking him isn’t good…

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.910
Make sure my face isn’t in the picture.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:23.480
He’s here!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.610
Yuzuki, hide!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.140
Dad?!

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:41.100
Itsuko-chan, you…?

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:42.560
Mom!?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:45.190
What are you doing here at this time of night!?

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:47.030
What are you trying to do?!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.030
Why…

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.540
Why?!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.030
Your teacher…

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.850
Tange-sensei told us!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.130
What?

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:58.720
Itsuko…

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:07.440
Your grudge shall be released.

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.620
I can’t forgive him…

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.650
There’s no way I’ll forgive him!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.750
I can’t forgive him…

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.970
There’s no way I’ll forgive him!

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.680
Tange Hideto

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:39.990
Jigoku…

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.450
…Shoujo?

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.030
Yamawaro.

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:47.570
Yes, Ojou.

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.500
Take this.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:57.040
If you really want to release your grudge, just pull the red string.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:06.450
If you pull the string, you'll sign a contract with me.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:11.480
The object of your grudge will promptly be sent to hell.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.670
To hell…

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:14.810
However,

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:18.160
there is a price.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:21.000
If you curse one person, two holes are created.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:31.010
If you sign the contract, your soul will also be sent to hell.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.250
Me too…?

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:38.310
Only after you die.

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:47.520
Without being able to go to heaven, your soul will taste pain and suffering, wandering hell for eternity.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.290
Stop joking!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:55.030
Why do I have to go to hell for someone like him?

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:58.950
The rest is up to you.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.250
Wait! Jigoku Shoujo!

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:18.100
What… {tlc this part}

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:18.920
What…

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.270
…was that?

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.520
I am inside of you…

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:33.190
Me?

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.740
Hiraishi, what are you trying to do?

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:56.770
Hey!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.670
What’s that look for?

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:10.690
Pick it up.  I’ll make you pay for it if it’s broken.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.750
What are you doing?

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:15.650
I’m confiscating it.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:16.420
Give it back!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:23.430
Hiraishi Itsuko. Right.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.640
Itsuko!

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:28.530
Let her be, Mikage.

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:34.150
Whee… Ah!

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:36.070
See you later!

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.250
Bye bye!

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.600
I’m so tired!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.970
And I was so hungry my stomach was rumbling!

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.380
Me too!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.620
I’m famished!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.890
Itsuko…

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:04.230
It’s not there…  Not there…

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.400
What are you doing?

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:08.670
Are you looking for what I confiscated?

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.350
I hid it there…

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.080
I already threw it away.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.350
Threw it away?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.290
Because you litsen to it while studying at home,

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.990
you can’t concentrate in class, either.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:20.840
What are you doing?

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:25.380
I’m asking you what you’re writing!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.610
If you don’t want me to write things, then be more serious!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.110
You’re in your third year!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:32.450
You’re going to write it in my school report?

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.870
You’re going to tell my parents again, aren’t you?

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.330
Is it fun bullying students?

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:42.230
Bullying?  You’re the one at fault.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:45.090
You want me to become unemployed, don’t you?

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:46.230
What?

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.230
I know.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:51.720
You’ve made three people unemployed so far, haven’t you?

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:53.580
Don’t be stupid.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:18:00.820
You’re taking out your stress on the students, aren’t you?

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.590
You’re the worst kind of teacher!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:07.830
I won’t accept being unemployed!

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.850
Itsuko!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.390
You’re going to hell…

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:20.490
No…

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.220
What are you trying to do, Hiraishi?

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:30.090
Trying to curse me?

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.550
Hah! You’re watching too much anime!

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:35.450
Nonsense!  Even though you’re in your third year…

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:43.940
Your revenge has been heard…

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.560
Itsuko!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.240
Where am I?

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:52.290
What’s going on?

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.320
That’s a two, Sensei.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:59.380
But apparently it’s a bit alive.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:04.350
Apparently, Arabic numerals are Indian numerals in Arabic.

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:08.090
Oh really? And?

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:09.400
I don’t care what it is!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:10.890
Help me!

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:12.330
So he says, Ojou.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:21.870
Ojou?

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.230
What <i>is</i> that?

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.050
The bee’s sting on a human.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.990
What are you going to do to me?

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:33.460
You’re going to hell for us!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.370
Seems you’ve won someone’s hatred, Sensei.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:38.140
Never!

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:40.830
I was always thinking about my students!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.230
They’re anxious.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.810
At that age, of course…

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:50.870
Trapped in darkness, O pitiful shadow…

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:53.600
Hurting people and degrading people…

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.700
The ball of karma is drowned in sin…

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:03.230
Do you want to try dying this once?

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.220
Pi.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:29.280
3.141592653…

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:33.820
This grudge will send you to hell.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:44.230
Itsuko?

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:49.120
It’s for everyone…

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.900
Itsuko, I finally found you!

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:00.690
Akie…

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:03.870
Tange-sensei told me to return this to you.

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:05.560
What?

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:09.430
He was laughing that next time you bring it to school, he’ll throw it away.

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:13.370
Tange-sensei isn’t a bad teacher after all!

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:22.100
What’s this?  It’s Tange-sensei’s!

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:29.270
In Tange-sensei’s notepad, neither names nor words were written.

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:37.730
Itsuko transferred schools the next day.

00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:49.230
Note: Candle says, Hiraishi Itsuko.

00:22:44.570 --> 00:22:49.230
I’ll release the grudge that you can’t.

00:24:19.700 --> 00:24:45.510
Preview

00:24:19.700 --> 00:24:45.510
Preview

00:24:20.210 --> 00:24:22.530
Your name?

00:24:22.530 --> 00:24:23.740
Kitayama Akira.

00:24:23.740 --> 00:24:25.830
I understand your feelings, but…

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:28.230
That person is suffering!

00:24:28.230 --> 00:24:30.250
Even if he wants to, he can't leave!

00:24:30.250 --> 00:24:32.640
I can't watch anymore!

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:35.700
Maybe you should calm down a bit…

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:37.250
I've got to rescue her.

00:24:37.250 --> 00:24:40.290
Please, send that person to hell!

00:24:42.170 --> 00:24:45.510
Your revenge, it is received.

00:24:45.540 --> 00:24:49.680
Caged Bird

00:24:45.640 --> 00:24:48.270
Next time, Caged Bird.

00:24:50.940 --> 00:24:58.680
